- [ ] Read build output and `.runtime/browser-build.json`; verify source/manifest
      binding and actual renderer/compiler imports. Build replaces its own dist;
      it is not a harmless read of an existing reviewed distribution.
- [ ] Read the smoke result for license, runtime assets, SQLite and actual card
      rendering. It proves neither the complete development suite nor full parity.
- [ ] Use only disposable synthetic data. Demo preparation copies database and
      files and refuses an existing demo; no copying is authorized in this task.
- [ ] Verify the frozen host's actual health/Home/stop protocol and complete
      child/resource cleanup. The retained host-check helper includes a SIGTERM
